{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"token","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the half that carries security weight: the input arrives unsolicited, from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network, and instructs the RP to terminate a session. Every check below is required, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each exists because skipping it has a name:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Signature against the OP’s JWKS, through the same §12.4 verifier — no second","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key-fetching path.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iss"},{"type":"text","text":" matches the discovery issuer; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aud"},{"type":"text","text":" contains this client’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_id"},{"type":"text","text":". A token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"minted for another RP is not accepted here."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"events"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the back-channel logout key with an object value. This is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguishes a logout token from an ID token; skipping it accepts a replayed ID token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a logout instruction."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nonce"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"absent","type":"text"}]},{"text":". Back-Channel Logout 1.0 §2.4 forbids it, and its presence is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the documented signature of an ID token being replayed — rejected, not ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At least one of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"type":"text","text":" is present. A token naming neither identifies nothing."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"exp"},{"type":"text","text":" is in the future and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iat"},{"type":"text","text":" recent."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/sid","isActive":true},{"text":" is present, end that session only.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Falling back to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“every session for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"text":"” when a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"text":" was supplied is the same over-reach the server","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses to make.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is surfaced so the caller can deduplicate; this SDK does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not dedup internally (§12.7.3 rule 7) — delivery is at-least-once, and a library with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"durable store would silently drop a real second logout after a restart."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/verifylogouttoken(_:configuration:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","title":"verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC17verifyLogoutToken_13configurationAA08VerifiedeF0VSS_AA17OidcConfigurationVtYaKF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verifyLogoutToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "}